# LaunchAgents installed during the hub build rather than machine setup.
install-token-rotator|not installed by setup: rotation updates only the Cloudflare relay and Keychain, not the cicd Secret or GitHub secret (docs/bugs/2026-10-30-machine-setup-installs-hub-agents-before-cutover.md)
install-hub-snapshot|installed by the cluster deploy (hub build, v1.43.12 plan 2)
install-hub-data-export|installed by the cluster deploy (hub build, v1.43.12 plan 2)
install-vault-failover|installed by the cluster deploy (hub build, v1.43.12 plan 2)
install-prometheus-auth-proxy|installed by the cluster deploy (hub build, v1.43.12 plan 2)
install-prometheus-credential-rotator|installed by the cluster deploy (hub build, v1.43.12 plan 2)
